{
	title: 'Local overrides',
	description: 'Any gitignored foo.local.ts beside a module may replace functions on that module object; startup applies all of them before initialization. A missing override is normal. ./test typechecks local files and smoke-imports them in a separate process, but ordinary tests run without them. Prove it with one real config function, such as the default model.',
